    "name": "Neuphonic Agents Sse API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Neuphonic is an ultra-low-latency voice AI platform providing real-time text-to-speech synthesis, voice cloning, and conversational AI agent management. The API supports SSE streaming, voice management, and agent lifecycle operations. Authentication uses API keys via the X-API-KEY header or api_key query parameter.\n",
